{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108520","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108520","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1510852001:0":{"text":"네가 직접 만든 거야?","source_cn":"是你亲手做的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD504A4A641EE10E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510852002:0":{"text":"응. 아쿠보르에서는 남자들이 사랑하는 여자의 모습을 조각해서, 부족의 프로포즈 축제에 선물하는 풍습이 있다고 들었거든.","source_cn":"嗯。我听说在雅库伯尔的习俗里，男人会按照心爱女人的模样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB7162208EA772F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510852003:1":{"text":"만약 여자가 조각상을 받으면, 그 마음을 받아주는 거라고 말이야.","source_cn":"如果女方愿意收下石雕，就代表接受这段感情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17788D0FF848D036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510852004:1":{"text":"난 아쿠보르인도 아니고, 선물도 조금 늦긴 했지만 네가 후회하는 걸 보고 싶지는 않아. 다른 사람이 가진 건, 너도 다 가지게 해줄게.","source_cn":"我不是雅库伯尔人，这份礼物也有点迟，但我不希望给你留下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4570086E6C0F1ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510852005:0":{"text":"...페르세우스.","source_cn":"……珀尔修斯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B2EFDF19FC4C52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510852006:0":{"text":"왜 그래, 마음에 안 들어?","source_cn":"怎么了，你不愿意收下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D9E6E95A5474637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510852007:0":{"text":"아니. 마음에 들어.\n이건 네가 나한테 주는 <style=\"highlight\">이별 선물</style>이라고 생각할게.","source_cn":"不，我愿意收下。\\n就当做是你给我的<style=hi...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AB5008AC2509E05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510852008:0":{"text":"이별...? 잠깐, 그게 무슨 소리야.","source_cn":"送别……？等等，我没听懂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A05501E329A8953","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510852009:0":{"text":"우린 한동안 다시 만날 수 없을거야. 난 사냥의 신에게 목숨을 바쳐야 하거든.","source_cn":"我们不能再见面了，因为我要向狩猎神献上自己的生命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x249F786D0E4612F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510852010:0":{"text":"모, 목숨을 바친다고? 아쿠보르가 널 제물로 선택했다는 거야?!","source_cn":"献、献上生命？雅库伯尔选择了你作为祭品？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA366B56AEF9F2461","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510852011:0":{"text":"응. 내겐 크나큰 영광이야.","source_cn":"是啊，我非常荣幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4540D39B2F08AD73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510852012:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">사냥의 신 오르파가</style> 님의 제물이 되는 건 모든 아쿠보르인의 소원이야. 내 영혼은 오르파가 님의 곁에서 안식을 취하게 되겠지.","source_cn":"能被献给<style=highlight>狩猎神奥法迦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B028B3C19E9DB86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510852013:0":{"text":"하지만... 넌 신의 사도잖아? 신을 대신해 신도들에게 신탁을 전하는 게 너의 일인데, 어째서 널 죽이려는 거냐고!","source_cn":"可你……你不是她的神使吗？你的任务是替神明向信徒传达神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0D2E02EE55E6B51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510852014:0":{"text":"사냥의 신께서 날 선택하신 거야. 사냥의 신께서는 <style=\"highlight\">신전을 봉쇄하고, 깊은 잠에 들어 더 강한 힘을 축적하셔야 해</style>.","source_cn":"是狩猎神选中了我，因为她要<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE667331B89336A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510852015:0":{"text":"이런 중요한 순간이 오면, 신의 사도인 나는 반드시 기도 의식에서 목숨을 바쳐야 해. 그래야만 <style=\"highlight\">내 영혼이 신전으로 들어가 사냥의 신을 모실 수 있으니까</style>.","source_cn":"这种重要的时刻，作为神使我必须在祝祷祭礼上舍弃生命。如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23FF1A4DFBA20620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510852016:0":{"text":"그게 뭐야... 사냥의 신을 모시기 위해서 목숨까지 바치겠다고?","source_cn":"这算什么……为了侍奉狩猎神，要你付出生命你也愿意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07CD18E06F54DEDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510852017:0":{"text":"물론이지. 이건 특별한 영광이니까. 다른 사람은 감히 바랄 수도 없는 은총이야.","source_cn":"当然，这是殊荣，是其他人求都求不到的恩典。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFBDC53A72893549","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510852018:0":{"text":"페르세우스, 사냥의 신께서 얼마나 존귀하신지 알잖아. 날 위해 기뻐해야지.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，你知道狩猎神是如此尊贵，你该为我高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90DE03EC1F2CAC4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510852019:0":{"text":"널 위해 기뻐해 달라고...? 그럼 난? 난 뭔데?","source_cn":"为你高兴……那我呢？我算什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90B3CD6A1D1487C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510852020:0":{"text":"...왜 그런 말을 하는 거야? 내가 사랑을 위해서 내 신앙을 포기할 거라고 생각했어?","source_cn":"……你为什么会说出这种话？难道你以为我会为了爱情，放弃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x657FFCEE663E7CA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510852021:0":{"text":"그렇게 생각한 적도 없고, 감히 그런 생각을 할 수도 없었어!","source_cn":"我没这么想过！我根本不敢这么想！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BE2996AEE3CDB98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1510852022:0":{"text":"넌, 계속 살아 있어야 해. 내가 다시 널 찾아올 때까지 기다려.","source_cn":"你，好好生活下去，等我再次找到你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2303C41366184A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1510852023:0":{"text":"...네가 날 다시 찾아온다고?","source_cn":"……等你找到我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B34156DFBF6462","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1510852024:0":{"text":"응. <style=\"highlight\">다음 생</style>에 꼭 다시 널 찾아올게.","source_cn":"是啊，<style=highlight>下一世</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36E5ADA574D68ACB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510852025:0":{"text":"사냥의 신께서 날 다시 네 곁으로 보내주실 거야. 난 오르파가 님의 사도니까. 우리 사랑을 이해하시고 내 작은 소원을 들어주시겠다고 약속하셨어.","source_cn":"狩猎神会将我再次送到你身边。我是她的神使，她谅解我和你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB1082B49AB08981","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510852026:0":{"text":"다 거짓말이라고 말해 줘...","source_cn":"告诉我，你不是认真的，你只是在开玩笑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x781A692975CF372E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1510852027:0":{"text":"슬퍼하지 마. 우린 잠시 헤어지는 것뿐이니까. 언젠간 다시 만날 수 있을 거야.","source_cn":"不要悲伤。我们只是暂时分别，总有一天会重逢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x948E28E2C298884D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1510852028:0":{"text":"그때가 되면, 꼭 나를 알아봐 줘야 해.","source_cn":"到时候，你要认出我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x068AE8BBECB28C6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1510852029:1":{"text":"…...","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8383C81AFA3C5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1510852030:0":{"text":"페르세우스, 약속해 줘. 날 알아보겠다고, 응?","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，我要你保证。你会认出我的，对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE683CC6CFD14E2EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1510852031:0":{"text":"응... 물론이지...","source_cn":"对……我当然会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x896DE2DB815AF2FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1510852032:0":{"text":"약속할 수 있어?","source_cn":"你保证？<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEFFFEB2C3D971C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1510852033:0":{"text":"약속할게...","source_cn":"我保证……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90CEA6CC23F25507","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:露":{"text":"루","source":"露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:珀尔修斯":{"text":"페르세우스","source":"珀尔修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":34,"localized_text_count":33,"speaker_count":2}}